00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:35.780
earlier openings in Roye, Sena, Mignant, and Macon. The addition improves long-distance travel

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:43.420
comfort on the European network. Drivers now have reliable indoor space for rest or work,

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:50.840
while vehicles charge, which reduces the friction of longer trips. Similar facilities help position

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:59.240
Tesla's charging network as more than just fast plugs. Before we go, keep an eye on how Tesla

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:06.360
